<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Billing & Medical Aid Management</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A high-integrity revenue cycle engine that automates the complex transition from 
            clinical events to financial settlement, ensuring the sustainability of your facility.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Unified Revenue Capture</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate revenue leakage with automated charge capture. The system monitors the 
            entire clinical workflow—consultations, lab investigations, pharmacy 
            dispensing, radiology procedures, and ward stays—automatically consolidating 
            these events into a single patient ledger. Multi-currency support allows 
            for the generation of invoices in both USD and ZiG, with support for 
            hybrid payments across mobile money, bank transfers, and cash 
            installments.
        </p>
        <p>
            Standardized price lists for different patient tiers—Private, Corporate, 
            and Diplomatic—ensure that the correct rates are applied automatically 
            based on the patient's registration profile.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated Medical Aid Claims</h2>
        <p>
            Accelerate your cash flow through professional claims orchestration. The system 
            automatically formats billing data into compliant claim submissions for 
            Zimbabwe's leading medical aid societies, including CIMAS, PSMAS, and 
            Premier. Automated validation checks—performed against membership card data 
            and pre-authorization numbers captured at registration—ensure that only 
            clean, valid claims are transmitted, significantly reducing the rate 
            of rejections and rework.
        </p>
        <p>
            Bulk claim submission and status tracking allow billing teams to manage 
            high-volume insurance relationships efficiently, with a clear view of 
            outstanding receivables from each society.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Credit Control & Debt Management</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain financial discipline with integrated credit management tools. The system 
            highlights patient accounts with outstanding balances, allowing for the 
            application of credit limits and the management of payment arrangements. 
            Detailed 'Aging Reports' provide a surgical view of the facility's 
            receivables, identifying overdue accounts for follow-up and informing 
            organizational financial strategy.
        </p>
        <p>
            Direct integration with the central ERP's Accounts Receivable module 
            ensures that healthcare revenue is accurately reflected in the 
            organization's overall financial statements, providing the 
            transparency needed for annual audits.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

